2num%22%3A50%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22num%22%3A4%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1667834950839\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/72350798/f8f7c0425bb46f9c0855c4caa255ec23_3354578464824430256.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">409</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">35</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">意识之键洗尽铅华后的姿态，聚阴阳明晦之力，成普度众生之莲。莲华轻旋，烦恼皆忘却；飞羽三千，尘嚣亦久湮——唯留一片纯白世界，自在空明。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">意识之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:26秒]爆发意识之键的力量，使周围敌人无法行动，最多持续8秒（对精英敌人和BOSS最多持续3秒）。无法行动的敌人受到装备者或队伍中其他角色攻击1秒后，会使其和周围小范围内敌人受到2,150%攻击力的火焰元素伤害（每个敌人只会受到1次伤害）并恢复行动。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">翎火燎燃</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">受主动技能影响的敌人恢复行动后，对其施加持续15秒的错乱效果，被攻击时装备者对其额外造成攻击力（100.0%+X*100.0%）的火焰元素伤害（冷却时间1秒，X为触发次数），且若X为5，则会清除所有敌人的错乱效果并对大范围内敌人造成1,500.0%的火焰元素伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">尘嚣渡净</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色全伤害提高35.0%，攻击的能量回复速度提高30.0%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">意识之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色造成的全元素伤害提高22.0%，对处于麻痹、冻结、点燃状态敌人额外提高22.0%</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/138/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/28/72350798/2ba4e7cb8da0be81f50ce7ad58e4bec7_6041848651506333429.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「神之键·羽渡尘」图鉴（经过调律），锻造武器获得</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><